        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kaapma kalang bam mei",
            "Ningsumei kandih khou",
            "Tingkau salemram gaimeita ning e",
            "Pap riita ngam lana",
            "Theimei ta ping lak khe",
            "Hei neihlaa na bam ni e.",
            "",
            "2. Hei kandi hei zauna",
            "Zingmei rui duamliam the",
            "Rianramei nanun guai kalang bam e,",
            "Neihlamei munpuang guay",
            "Puanghtuay puni e",
            "He aramta ai ning e.] 2",
            "",
            "3. He! Nang zei pan khou rui .",
            "Kau nam daita nkhuan",
            "Duipang thang jian mei guaita",
            "Bamcham khang,",
            "Khou tei zaikan lou o,",
            "Tingkao than mei ram khou",
            "He! Ai bam kazau ni e.] 2",
            "",
            "4. Salem namthan gai khou.",
            "Ai guang tang pui nung kiw",
            "Kao nthanmei nun le kanloumei nun,",
            "Guang bam hu khou ding na",
            "Neihlaa puilu suan ni.",
            "He! Halleluijah tuna.] 2"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
